        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-09-10T12:15:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We keep saying \"Well, where could he hide in the world?\" while forgetting this is a world where Atlantis&nbsp;<em>definitely</em> existed. Maybe he got himself stuck in Lemuria, or rocketed to Mars or something.</p>",
