        "created_at": "2017-09-10T17:27:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think TakeWalker was more so pointing out that there are plenty of places that are just unknown, forgotten, or ignored by the world at large, and using Atlantis as an example. If Haka is in a forgotten place like that, there is very little reason to expect he's on anyone's radar.</p>",
