        "created_at": "2017-09-11T00:50:28.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>From the Wiki:&nbsp;</p><blockquote><p>One morning, after the night of a great battle, his Tā Moko, the facial tattoos identifying him as a Maori warrior, faded completely</p></blockquote><p>Preventing the ease of putting them on, that was likely his vitality and healing factor. I actually like that even more so for the Ta Moko card being his DR, not because of his actual wearing of the Ta Moko, but that the DR is because of his innate vitality and toughness, which had to be overcome<em> by him</em> to put the Ta Moko back on.</p>",
